tree parser
├── when parsing a basic tree
│   ├── it resolves the root name
│   ├── it nests children by indentation
│   └── it records line numbers
├── when the file has multiple trees
│   └── it splits them on blank lines
└── when the tree is malformed
    ├── it rejects children under it nodes
    ├── it rejects unknown node keywords
    ├── it rejects depth jumps
    └── it rejects empty files
